[center][size=5][color=#00B176][b]SimpleIME-Unofficial-Update[/b][/color][/size]
[size=3]Native IME support for Skyrim SE/AE · 为上古卷轴5 SE/AE 提供完整输入法支持[/size]
[size=2]v3.1.2-beta · based on upstream v2.2.1 by cyfewlp · GPL-3.0-or-later[/size][/center]

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]What is this? · 这是什么？[/b][/color][/size]

SimpleIME is a SKSE plugin that brings full IME (Input Method Editor) support to Skyrim SE/AE. It intercepts the OS input pipeline, activates your system input method automatically whenever a text field takes focus, and renders the composition string and candidate list natively inside the game with ImGui — so you can type Chinese, Japanese, Korean and other multi-byte languages in the console, in SkyUI search fields, and in every text box your mods expose.

[b]This is the community-maintained continuation[/b] of [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/140136]cyfewlp's SimpleIME[/url], developed from upstream v2.2.1. On top of the original feature set it adds IME input for modern mod UI frameworks ([b]Meridian UI[/b], [b]SKSE Menu Framework[/b] and [b]Prisma UI[/b]), fixes the stuck-IME and window-switching crash bugs, makes the UI sharp on high-DPI displays, and ships a redesigned settings window, language bar and default themes.

SimpleIME 是一个 SKSE 插件，为上古卷轴5 SE/AE 解锁完整的输入法（IME）支持。它接管系统输入管道，在文本框获得焦点时自动激活系统输入法，并用 ImGui 在游戏内原生渲染组字串与候选词窗口——让你能在控制台、SkyUI 搜索框以及一切模组文本框中输入中文、日文、韩文等多字节语言。

[b]本页面是社区维护的非官方续更版[/b]，基于上游作者 cyfewlp 的 SimpleIME v2.2.1 继续开发：新增 Meridian UI、SKSE Menu Framework、Prisma UI 三大模组 UI 框架的输入法支持，修复了输入法卡死与切窗崩溃等顽疾，解决了高缩放屏 UI 发虚问题，并重做了设置界面、语言栏与默认主题。

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]Features · 功能[/b][/color][/size]

[size=3][b]Core · 核心功能[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Automatic activation[/color] — the IME turns on when a text field takes focus and off when you leave it; no manual toggling. The hotkey (default F2, rebindable in settings) opens the tool window to check or switch the active input method.
[color=#CDC2DB]自动激活[/color] —— 聚焦文本框自动开启输入法，离开自动停用；快捷键（默认 F2，可在设置中改键）打开工具窗口查看/切换输入法。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]In-game language bar[/color] — shows the active IME and input-mode light, with IME switching, pin button and settings entry; auto shows/hides with text entry.
[color=#CDC2DB]游戏内语言栏[/color] —— 显示当前输入法与输入状态灯，支持切换输入法、图钉固定与设置入口；随文本输入自动显示/隐藏。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]TSF-based, rendered in-game[/color] — uses the modern Text Services Framework (Imm32 fallback included); composition and candidates are drawn by SimpleIME itself, supporting horizontal and vertical candidate lists, so no OS candidate window ever floats over the screen.
[color=#CDC2DB]基于 TSF、游戏内渲染[/color] —— 使用现代文字服务框架（TSF，含 Imm32 回退），组字串与候选词由本插件自行绘制，支持横/竖排候选，屏幕上不再出现系统候选窗。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Caret tracking[/color] — the IME window follows the active text cursor on screen, including in scrollable fields.
[color=#CDC2DB]光标追踪[/color] —— 输入法窗口自动跟随当前文本光标，支持可滚动的文本框。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Font Builder[/color] — browse all installed fonts or load one from a file, preview in real time, and assign separate fonts for Latin, CJK and emoji glyphs. UI icons ship as a repackaged minimal [url=https://lucide.dev]Lucide[/url] TTF.
[color=#CDC2DB]字体构建器[/color] —— 浏览所有已安装字体（或从文件加载），实时预览，可为拉丁、CJK、Emoji 分别指定字体。UI 图标由精简版 [url=https://lucide.dev]Lucide[/url] 字体提供。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Theme Builder (Material You)[/color] — pick any seed color and the whole palette is generated in real time via Google's HCT color space; dark and light mode included.
[color=#CDC2DB]主题构建器（Material You）[/color] —— 任意种子颜色经 Google HCT 色彩空间实时生成整套配色，支持深色/浅色模式。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Unicode paste[/color] — paste Unicode text from the clipboard into any text field (Ctrl+V).
[color=#CDC2DB]Unicode 粘贴[/color] —— 从剪贴板粘贴 Unicode 文本到任意文本框（Ctrl+V）。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Six UI languages[/color] — English, Chinese, German, Japanese, Korean and Russian ship in the package; add more by dropping a [i]translate_italiano.toml[/i]-style file into [i]interface/SimpleIME/[/i].
[color=#CDC2DB]六种界面语言[/color] —— 自带英语、中文、德语、日语、韩语、俄语；将 [i]translate_italiano.toml[/i] 这样的文件放入 [i]interface/SimpleIME/[/i] 即可扩展。
[/list]

[size=3][b]What this fork adds · 本续更版新增[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Meridian UI input (CEF)[/color] — Meridian-based UIs (e.g. [b]Tailor[/b]) render through CEF, so game char-events never reach them. SimpleIME notices a Meridian view gaining focus, engages the IME, and delivers committed text through a JS bridge that fires the page's native input events — composition and candidates render as a themed floating panel inside the page.
[color=#CDC2DB]Meridian UI 输入（CEF）[/color] —— Meridian 界面（如 [b]Tailor[/b]）由 CEF 渲染，游戏字符事件无法到达。SimpleIME 在 Meridian 视图获得焦点时自动激活输入法，通过注入的 JS 桥提交文字并触发页面原生 input 事件；组字与候选以主题化浮层显示在页面内。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]SKSE Menu Framework input (ImGui)[/color] — SKSEMF menus draw their text fields with the framework's own ImGui, which never raises the game's text-entry counter. SimpleIME resolves SKSEMF's public exports, acquires a text-entry lease through the native [i]AllowTextInput[/i] when a field wants text (language bar included), and injects committed characters on the framework's render callback. Plain English typing is untouched. Requires [b]SKSEMenuFramework.dll 3.7+[/b].
[color=#CDC2DB]SKSE Menu Framework 输入（ImGui）[/color] —— SKSEMF 界面的文本框使用框架自带 ImGui 绘制，从不触发游戏的文本输入计数。SimpleIME 解析其公开导出，在字段需要输入时经原生 [i]AllowTextInput[/i] 取得文本输入租约（语言栏照常出现），并在框架渲染回调中注入上屏文字。纯英文输入完全不受影响。需要 [b]SKSEMenuFramework.dll 3.7+[/b]。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Prisma UI input (Ultralight)[/color] — Prisma-based UIs (e.g. [b]PMCM[/b], [b]HeroAvatarHUD[/b], [b]Outfit Wheeler[/b]) render their text fields through Ultralight, which neither stock activation nor Prisma's own helper alone can drive for a full IME session. SimpleIME polls Prisma's public [i]IVPrismaUI1[/i] focus state, engages the IME when a Prisma view gains focus, and commits typed text through the game window's message stream into the focused field; editing keys are forwarded while typing, and the candidate window is kept on top of Prisma's rendering, anchored to the clicked text field. If PrismaUI.dll is present but its API is unavailable, SimpleIME fails safe and leaves IME handling entirely to PrismaUI.
[color=#CDC2DB]Prisma UI 输入（Ultralight）[/color] —— Prisma 界面（如 [b]PMCM[/b]、[b]HeroAvatarHUD[/b]、[b]Outfit Wheeler[/b]）的文本框由 Ultralight 渲染，仅靠系统激活或 Prisma 自带的输入助手都无法完成完整的输入法会话。SimpleIME 只读查询 Prisma 公开的 [i]IVPrismaUI1[/i] 焦点状态，在 Prisma 视图获得焦点时自动激活输入法，并将上屏文字经游戏窗口消息流写入当前字段；输入期间转发编辑按键，候选窗始终绘制在 Prisma 画面之上并锚定到所点击的文本框。若 PrismaUI.dll 存在但 API 不可用，SimpleIME 会完全退避，把输入处理交还给 PrismaUI 以保证安全。
[*]All three integrations negotiate [b]public extension interfaces only[/b] and are inert when the host DLL is absent — install them whenever you like.
[*]三种集成仅协商[b]公开扩展接口[/b]，宿主 DLL 不存在时自动失效——随时可选装。
[/list]

[size=3][b]What this fork fixes · 本续更版修复[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Stuck IME around mod menus[/color] — the root cause (a leaked text-entry counter that kept the IME, language bar and paused tool window on after leaving a mod window) is healed by event repair plus an every-frame poll; every disable path now also hides the language bar and returns Win32 focus to the game.
[color=#CDC2DB]模组菜单导致的输入法卡死[/color] —— 根因是文本输入计数泄漏（离开模组窗口后输入法、语言栏与暂停的工具窗口常开），现通过事件修复 + 逐帧轮询治愈；所有停用路径都会收起语言栏并把 Win32 焦点还给游戏。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Upstream's window-switch crash[/color] — switching windows via [b]Win+Shift+S[/b] (or Alt-Tab with a key held) during CJK composition no longer crashes or leaves phantom keys stuck in ImGui; focus steal, teardown and cross-thread COM paths are hardened throughout.
[color=#CDC2DB]上游切窗崩溃[/color] —— CJK 组字期间用 [b]Win+Shift+S[/b]（或按住按键 Alt-Tab）切窗不再崩溃、不再残留幽灵按键；焦点抢占、析构与跨线程 COM 路径全面加固。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Sharp UI on scaled displays[/color] — the process is made per-monitor-v2 DPI aware (opt-out in config), so the settings UI and language bar are no longer stretched blurry at 125%+ system scaling.
[color=#CDC2DB]缩放屏 UI 发虚[/color] —— 进程声明为 Per-Monitor-V2 DPI 感知（可在配置关闭），125%+ 系统缩放下设置界面与语言栏不再被拉伸模糊。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Correct CJK font rendering[/color] — font sizes are interpreted as em (upstream's asc+desc span rendered CJK ~25% smaller and squeezed bottom strokes), and FreeType hinting no longer clips glyph bottoms.
[color=#CDC2DB]CJK 字形渲染修正[/color] —— 字号按 em 语义解释（上游按 asc+desc 跨度计算导致 CJK 比同号拉丁字小约 25%、底笔画被挤），FreeType 提示不再裁掉字形底部。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Redesigned settings window[/color] — live status strip, a compatibility card showing per-bridge support state, one-click diagnostics copy, hot log-level switching, open-config/log links, and new default dark & light themes.
[color=#CDC2DB]设置界面重做[/color] —— 实时状态条、显示各桥接支持状态的兼容性卡片、一键复制诊断信息、日志级别热切换、打开配置/日志链接，以及全新默认深/浅主题。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]Candidate window placement & layering[/color] — the candidate window anchors to the focused text field from the first keystroke (including framework menus, via the framework's own caret reporting), stays put while composing instead of chasing the cursor, and is always drawn on top of Prisma UI and SKSE Menu Framework menus.
[color=#CDC2DB]候选窗定位与层级[/color] —— 候选窗从第一次敲键起即锚定到焦点文本框（框架菜单经由框架自身的插入符上报），组词期间位置锁定、不再跟随鼠标漂移，并始终绘制在 Prisma UI 与 SKSE Menu Framework 菜单之上。
[*][color=#CDC2DB]中/英 indicator memory[/color] — the language bar no longer falls back to "EN" on every re-entry: IMEs that publish no mode state (e.g. WeChat) are tracked by behavior, and the last observed mode is remembered across disable/enable cycles and game restarts.
[color=#CDC2DB]中/英 状态记忆[/color] —— 语言栏不再每次进入输入态都回落到「英」：对不公布模式状态的输入法（如微信）按行为推断，并跨停用/启用与游戏重启记住上次的中/英状态。
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]Requirements · 需求[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Skyrim SE or AE[/b] (Address Library–based build: SE 1.5.97 through current AE) and the matching [b][url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE[/url][/b].
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library for SKSE Plugins[/url][/b] — the all-in-one file covering your runtime.
[*]A game font covering your language for in-game text (any Chinese/Japanese/Korean font mod). Not required for the IME windows themselves — SimpleIME uses your system fonts, and Font Builder can load any ttf/otf directly.
[*]Windows 8.1 or newer (TSF; older systems fall back to Imm32 with reduced features).
[*]Optional, auto-detected: [b]MeridianUI[/b] (Meridian input), [b]SKSEMenuFramework.dll 3.7+[/b] (SKSEMF input), [b]PrismaUI[/b] (Prisma UI input). Everything degrades to a no-op when the DLL is absent.
[/list]

[b]上古卷轴 SE/AE 本体与对应版 SKSE、Address Library、一款覆盖你语言的游戏字体 Mod（可选装 MeridianUI / SKSEMenuFramework 3.7+ / PrismaUI 以启用对应桥接，缺省自动失效）。[/b]

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]Installation · 安装[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Mod manager (recommended):[/b] install the archive with MO2/Vortex and enable it. Package layout: [i]SKSE/Plugins/SimpleIME.dll[/i] + [i]interface/SimpleIME/[/i] (config, translations, icon font).
[*][b]Manual:[/b] extract the archive into your game's [i]Data[/i] folder (same structure).
[*]Launch the game and press [b]F2[/b] — the tool window should show your active input method. Open the console or a SkyUI search field and start typing.
[*]Upgrading: replace the files; the config file is forward-compatible (new keys are additive, your values are kept).
[/list]

[b]推荐用 MO2/Vortex 安装；手动安装则将压缩包解压至游戏 Data 目录。进游戏按 F2 确认工具窗口显示当前输入法，即可在控制台或 SkyUI 搜索框直接输入。升级直接覆盖，配置向后兼容。[/b]

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]Compatibility · 兼容性[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*][b]SkyUI[/b] and all mods built on it (inventory search, NPC search, crafting filters, [b]Modex[/b], …) — fully supported.
[*][b]TMS_SIMEtoSKSEMF[/b] — mutually exclusive on the SKSE Menu Framework path. SimpleIME disables its built-in SKSEMF input when that plugin is present; keep one of the two.
[*][b]dMenu[/b] — not supported (own render/message pipeline). Mods that hook WM_CHAR for the same window during text entry may conflict.
[/list]

[b]SkyUI 系完整支持；TMS_SIMEtoSKSEMF 在 SKSEMF 路径上互斥（双方都会自动退让，按需二选一）；dMenu 不支持。详见 Articles 页。[/b]

[line]

[size=4][color=#00B176][b]Troubleshooting · 常见问题[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*]UI/text looks blurry → make sure [i]force_dpi_awareness = true[/i] (default) and you are not running the game through a scaling wrapper.
[*]No candidates appear → check the OS input method is enabled; press F2 to see whether SimpleIME sees it. [i]Settings → Advanced[/i] can copy a full diagnostics summary for bug reports.
[*]Typing does nothing in a SKSEMF menu → update SKSEMenuFramework.dll to 3.7 or newer.
[*]A mod menu swallows keystrokes after closing → make sure you are on the latest release; the leaked text-entry counter that caused this is fixed here.
[/list]

